{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23002","headline":"自江州司马授忠州刺史仰荷圣泽聊书鄙诚 · 白居易","name":"自江州司马授忠州刺史仰荷圣泽聊书鄙诚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"炎瘴抛身远，泥涂索脚难。\n网初鳞拨剌，笼久翅摧残。\n雷电颁时令，阳和变岁寒。\n遗簪承旧念，剖竹授新官。\n乡觉前程近，心随外事宽。\n生还应有分，西笑问长安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}